WEBVTT

00:02:58.299 --> 00:03:01.469
bu langar nuqtasi
Ekvatorga yaqin bo’lishi kerak .

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:05.389
Va yuk stansiyasini
mobil okean bazasiga aylantirib,

00:03:05.389 --> 00:03:08.226
butun tizim o’z xohishiga ko’ra 
ko’chirilishi mumkin,

00:03:08.226 --> 00:03:11.103
ekstremal ob-havo sharoitida
manevr qilish imkonini beradi ,

00:03:11.103 --> 00:03:14.106
va kosmosdagi qoldiqlar va
sun’iy yo’ldoshlardan qochish.

00:03:14.106 --> 00:03:19.195
So’ng, yuk alpinistlar deb nomlangan
qurilmalarga yuklanishi mumkin edi

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.990
bu kabel boylab 
paketlarni va orbitaga tortadi .

00:03:23.783 --> 00:03:27.286
Ushbu mexanizmlar katta miqdorda
elektr energiyasini talab qiladi ,

00:03:27.286 --> 00:03:32.250
quyosh panellari yoki potensial yoki yadro
tizimlari tomonidan ta’minlanishi mumkin.